Data and references
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Hong Kong Observatory material (src/calendars/chinese-hko-data.ts)
  Chinese lunisolar month boundaries 1901-2100 derived from the Hong Kong
  Observatory "Gregorian-Lunar Calendar Conversion Tables". Intellectual property
  rights: Government of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region. The Materials
  are part of the website https://www.hko.gov.hk, published by the Hong Kong
  Observatory. Used for non-commercial purposes free of charge under the HKO
  conditions; NOT covered by Apache-2.0 or CC BY 4.0. The HKO Intellectual
  Property Rights Notice, Conditions and Disclaimer are reproduced in
  third_party/hko/NOTICE.md. Commercial use requires HKO's written authorisation.

Official holiday dates are taken from decrees published by the Government of the
Republic of Indonesia (setkab.go.id, setneg.go.id, kemenkopmk.go.id,
jdih.kemnaker.go.id, peraturan.bpk.go.id, kemenag.go.id). Each record links to
its source. The project claims no rights in the decrees themselves.

Research captures of other calendar websites used during development are not
part of this repository or of any release, and are not covered by its licenses.
